                                                </div>

                                                  <span>Emitter certificate:</span> <span t-out="o.detalle_folio().get('certificate_number')">30001000000500003416</span>
                        <span> | SAT Certificate:</span> <span t-out="o.detalle_folio().get('certificate_sat_number')">30001000000500003442</span>
                        <span> | Expedition place:</span> <span t-out="o.detalle_folio().get('expedition')">20928</span>
